{%- comment -%}
Liquid template, regenerated at Jekyll build time from site.kalpasiddhisthana so
edits to the chapter text are picked up automatically -- no separate
index-build step. This text carries no footnote apparatus, so unlike
the e-Suśruta/e-Caraka index there is no <sup> content to strip; the
split is kept anyway for consistency with the rest of this site
family and in case a later addition does need it.
{%- endcomment -%}
[{% for c in site.kalpasiddhisthana %}{%- assign parts = c.content | split: '<sup' -%}
{%- capture body -%}{{ parts[0] }}{% for p in parts offset:1 %}{{ p | split: '</sup>' | last }}{% endfor %}{%- endcapture -%}
{"title": {{ c.title | jsonify }},"adhyaya": {{ c.adhyaya }},"url": {{ c.url | relative_url | jsonify }},"text": {{ body | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{% endfor %}]
